	(text "Note:	The Power subsystem (Separate PCB) Has connections to all the other subsystems\n		that are not represented in the top level schematic. These are handled by global\n		connectors for the following:\n			- GND		(-ve terminal of the battery)\n			- VBATT		(+ve terminal of the battery)\n			- R5V		(Regulated 5V)\n			- R3V3		(Regulated 3.3V)\n		For a breakdown of the power distribution see:"
